        "original_id": "2aefd370-7c16-5491-8f41-fdafff828829",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jason Schwartzman, Wes Anderson, Ben Stiller, Anna Kendrick, Roald Dahl, King Naresuan\n- Films: Fantastic Mr. Fox, Khan Kluay, Rushmore, The Darjeeling Limited, Moonrise Kingdom, The Grand Budapest Hotel, The Marc Pease Experience\n- Topics: animation films, film collaborations, literary adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Jason Schwartzman collaborated with Wes Anderson on the films Rushmore (1998), The Darjeeling Limited (2007), Fantastic Mr. Fox (2009), Moonrise Kingdom (2012), and The Grand Budapest Hotel (2014).\n- Khan Kluay is a 2006 Thai 3D computer-animated action-adventure comedy family film set in Ayutthaya-era Siam.\n- Khan Kluay follows a Thai elephant that wanders away from his mother and eventually becomes the war elephant of King Naresuan.\n- Fantastic Mr. Fox is a 2009 American stop-motion animated comedy film based on Roald Dahl's children's novel of the same name.\n- The Marc Pease Experience stars Jason Schwartzman as Pease, Ben Stiller as Marc's former mentor, and Anna Kendrick as his love interest.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
